                    insight_twosided:       `Two-sided recovery: NPS, match-success, repeat-usage and supply health all on a credible day-90 trajectory. You designed experience as a co-created system — fixing your own supply leak, protecting both sides, and engineering trust against the specific risk. This is the recovery that survives the next quarter.`,
                    insight_collapse:       `Consumer win, supply crisis: you lifted NPS and repeat-usage but let supply health collapse. The cross-side network effect is already biting — match quality is sliding because your best pros have left, and the consumer gains will follow them out the door.`,
                    insight_onesided:       `One-sided lift: consumers are happier, but the supply side hasn't recovered enough to be safe. On a marketplace that's a fragile win — the board's question of whether it survives is still open.`,
